{"4256450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Nova", "steam_appid": 4256450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/4e1ea3215f38c19100cc34bdc193858e.avif?t=1783150748\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>   Super Nova</strong> is a fast-paced sci-fi action game built with Unreal Engine 5, where humanity stands on the edge of             extinction</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the far reaches of space, a highly advanced alien world has begun invading and destroying planets one by one, harvesting their resources and enslaving entire civilizations. Earth is their next target.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/d421ba083d2c201af99226658f31f6e0.poster.avif?t=1783150748\" width=880 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/d421ba083d2c201af99226658f31f6e0.webm?t=1783150748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/d421ba083d2c201af99226658f31f6e0.mp4?t=1783150748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stop the invasion, <strong>three super-powered heroes</strong> rise — each bound by a unique cosmic ability. United by an oath to protect Earth, they prepare for the final stand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/664867a1f89b124106fc15a612ba5c9b.poster.avif?t=1783150748\" width=880 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/664867a1f89b124106fc15a612ba5c9b.webm?t=1783150748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/664867a1f89b124106fc15a612ba5c9b.mp4?t=1783150748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey begins aboard a <strong>space station orbiting near Earth</strong>. From there, the heroes launch into battle, piloting their spacecraft and descending into intense combat zones across the planet’s surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/794ab48ccf22cdbe0e3c7481b329240b.poster.avif?t=1783150748\" width=880 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/794ab48ccf22cdbe0e3c7481b329240b.webm?t=1783150748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/794ab48ccf22cdbe0e3c7481b329240b.mp4?t=1783150748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                          <strong><i>⚔️ Gameplay Features ⚔️</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <strong>three unique heroes</strong>, each with distinct powers and combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>high-intensity missions</strong> against waves of advanced enemy robots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete multiple <strong>objectives (quests)</strong> to clear invasion zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a massive <strong>boss battle</strong> at the end of each mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat a <strong>giant robotic boss</strong> with devastating abilities to achieve victory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/5e2490290cb2aede02d3349230436644.poster.avif?t=1783150748\" width=880 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/5e2490290cb2aede02d3349230436644.webm?t=1783150748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Nova delivers explosive combat, cinematic sci-fi action, and epic boss fights in a battle to save Earth from total annihilation.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/4e1ea3215f38c19100cc34bdc193858e.avif?t=1783150748\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>   Super Nova</strong> is a fast-paced sci-fi action game built with Unreal Engine 5, where humanity stands on the edge of             extinction</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the far reaches of space, a highly advanced alien world has begun invading and destroying planets one by one, harvesting their resources and enslaving entire civilizations. Earth is their next target.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/d421ba083d2c201af99226658f31f6e0.poster.avif?t=1783150748\" width=880 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/d421ba083d2c201af99226658f31f6e0