=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                          <strong><i>⚔️ Gameplay Features ⚔️</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <strong>three unique heroes</strong>, each with distinct powers and combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>high-intensity missions</strong> against waves of advanced enemy robots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete multiple <strong>objectives (quests)</strong> to clear invasion zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a massive <strong>boss battle</strong> at the end of each mission</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat a <strong>giant robotic boss</strong> with devastating abilities to achieve victory</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/5e2490290cb2aede02d3349230436644.poster.avif?t=1783150748\" width=880 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/extras/5e2490290cb2aede02d3349230436644.webm?t=1783150748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Nova delivers explosive combat, cinematic sci-fi action, and epic boss fights in a battle to save Earth from total annihilation.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Super Nova is a cooperative sci-fi action game where players unite as super-powered heroes to face waves of advanced robotic enemies and engage in massive boss battles to defend Earth from an alien invasion.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256450/ca25731d36efc3bd6eb3fbfe67cc7ddc3dece398/